Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: File Manager, one local place at a time
 A file manager built on GUI.Forms with protected filesystem authority and
 inspectable service boundaries.
 .
 Installed under @INSTALL_DIR@ with a launcher in /usr/bin. Requires an X11
 display (XWayland works). Bundled fonts; no host fonts are read. Bundled
 service executables are not installed as services or started.
